msgstr "Ontgrendellink kopiëren"

#: src/Support/I18n.php:196 src/Support/I18n.php:902
msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Opnieuw controleren"

#: src/Support/I18n.php:197 src/Support/I18n.php:648 src/Support/I18n.php:903
msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Controleren…"

#: src/Support/I18n.php:198
msgid "Allowed addresses"
msgstr "Toegestane adressen"

#: src/Support/I18n.php:199
msgid ""
"Single addresses (203.0.113.7) or ranges (203.0.113.0/24, 2001:db8::/64). "
"Turning Lockdown on and the unlock link add only the one address in use. "
"IPv6 addresses often change every day, so add your /64 range if you need it."
msgstr ""
"Losse adressen (203.0.113.7) of bereiken (203.0.113.0/24, 2001:db8::/64). "
"Lockdown inschakelen en de ontgrendellink voegen alleen het adres in gebruik"
" toe. IPv6-adressen veranderen vaak elke dag; voeg zo nodig je /64-bereik "
"toe."

#: src/Support/I18n.php:200
msgid "No addresses yet. Turning Lockdown on adds yours."
msgstr ""
"Nog geen adressen. Als je Lockdown aanzet, wordt het jouwe toegevoegd."

